==Battleground==
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hermit Peng]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Hermit Peng]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns.
**2 [[R.Ost]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using units like [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]], [[Jagando Jr. (Special Cat)|Jagando Jr.]], or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] will make this stage trivial. If you do not have them, using the [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dra]][[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|gon]] [[Brainwashed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|vari]][[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|ants]] or other [[:Category:Backliner-class Cats|Backliner]] units will make this stage easy with enough meatshielding. Nearly any [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]] specialist can of course be used to great effect here, as there are no non-[[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies present.

